# The settings screen: shown, the item order changed and saved, and read
# back when the screen is opened again.  The adapter and DOS version
# differ between machines and are masked.
#@ CFGHAS ITEMORD=LOC
M 8 19 26
M 9 61 18
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-O
T S
S SET
K DOWN DOWN DOWN SPACE
K CTRL-S
S SAVED
K ESC ALT-O
T S
S REREAD
K ESC
K F3
T Y
